-	 * XNU's private BootArgs copy, before the >1 GiB page-size decision.
+	 * BootArgs can only describe one contiguous range. Keep bootstrap/XNU's
+	 * early linear assumptions confined to the real 1000 MiB lower bank.
+	 * The upper 1 GiB bank is added later as a separate physical-aperture
